dot v4.7.dev (a3e84cc2a) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7260) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 15.79 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe button associated with the script name added in #112796 is accessible even when there is no file open, while this is basically unnoticed normally, if you are navigating the editor using keyboard you will notice this button rapidly. The button is able to be pressed, although nothing happens and you can get the tooltip to appear. It could maybe be restricted to when accessibility mode is on.\n\n<img width=\"1266\" height=\"492\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d0201a2-a7c5-4714-ab00-10c3c36f6ea5\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the script tab with nothing open\n- Go to where the file name should be moving the focus using keyboard navigation, or moving the mouse there, it should appear down of the start of the 3d icon\n- The tooltip should appear if you used the mouse\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/r